{
  "_comment": "Fast-moving boat.dev facts that boat-ops states. scripts/check-boat-facts.py guards this file: --offline checks that the skill prose still states each fact's skill_text and names each flag; --live checks each fact's pattern (a regex) against the docs page https://docs.boat.dev/<page>.md and each flag against the docs CLI reference and, when a boat CLI is installed, `boat --no-update help <sub>`. When a fact changes, re-read the page, then change pattern, skill_text, the prose and `verified` together.",
